1
00:00:01,213 --> 00:00:03,347
Let's see who dares kick me out

2
00:00:03,347 --> 00:00:05,317
I'm carrying a Jiang heir

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,290
He's your grandson

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,500
Could you bear letting him roam the streets?

5
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:14,280
Stop pretending

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,080
At your age

7
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,413
how could you even get pregnant?

8
00:00:16,413 --> 00:00:17,213
This is a hospital

9
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:18,663
I can't lie here

10
00:00:20,147 --> 00:00:21,480
Son, I'm begging you

11
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,900
I'm already ruined

12
00:00:23,347 --> 00:00:24,947
The Jiang family's only heir

13
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:25,955
Come out

14
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,880
I exposed my husband's affair

15
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,947
and was killed

16
00:00:28,947 --> 00:00:30,051
This life

17
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,344
