18
00:00:33,747 --> 00:00:34,547
Xiaolan, come

19
00:00:34,547 --> 00:00:36,077
come wash my feet

20
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,347
Zhang Guifen, don't push it

21
00:00:39,347 --> 00:00:40,413
Oh my

22
00:00:40,413 --> 00:00:42,013
My precious son says

23
00:00:42,013 --> 00:00:43,983
he wants Grandma serving him

24
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:45,213
If she doesn't serve well

25
00:00:45,213 --> 00:00:46,547
he won't come out

26
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:47,613
He'll just stay in there

27
00:00:47,613 --> 00:00:49,293
let's see who panics

28
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,213
You little cutie

29
00:00:53,213 --> 00:00:54,083
Honey

30
00:00:54,547 --> 00:00:56,177
Honey, calm down

31
00:00:56,413 --> 00:00:58,280
Careful of the baby in her belly

32
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,347
If not for the child

33
00:00:59,347 --> 00:01:00,947
