35
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,040
Don't hurt the baby

36
00:01:12,147 --> 00:01:13,480
Something's wrong

37
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,080
The way Jiang Chengang looked

38
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,390
that's not how you look at a daughter-in-law

39
00:01:21,213 --> 00:01:22,013
Oh Chengang

40
00:01:22,013 --> 00:01:23,347
gently now

41
00:01:23,347 --> 00:01:24,680
I'm carrying your child

42
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,970
don't crush him

